  m_text: Lethal Company is not a core Archipelago game, it needs a custom world
    file. When "lethal_company.apworld" is downloaded in the Archipelago Folder (by
    clicking START SETUP), boot-up the Archipelago Launcher and go to "Options Creator"
    to create your .yaml file and then, when you're done, send it to the person who
    will host the AP Multiworld.
