  m_text: 'Once everything is set up, a new "Archipelago Connection" window should
    appear in the main menu in the top-right corner.


    In the "Address : Port"
    field, enter archipelago.gg: followed by the port. This is a 5-digit number that
    you can find on the website after creating a new room.


    In "Slot Name",
    enter the name assigned to your YAML file.


    The "Password" field is optional.
    If the host did not set one, leave it blank.


    Finally, click "Connect" and
    then, you can start a new run!'
