  m_text: "When you click \"REVERT\" in the SETUP tab, the BepInEx folder, .doorstop_version,
    doorstop_config.ini, and winhttp.dll will be removed from the game directory.\n\nThe
    \"Clear AP mods\" option is enabled by default. It will only delete the 3 required
    files for the Archipelago.\n\t"
