  m_text: When you click "START SETUP" in the "SETUP" tab, content_warning.apworld
    will be installed and moved into the "custom_worlds" folder inside the Archipelago
    Launcher directory. BepInEx will then be downloaded into the game's core folder.
    All three required dlls will be installed inside the BepInEx\plugins directory.
