  m_text: STS 2 is not a core Archipelago game, it needs a custom world file (sts2.apworld).
    When "sts2.apworld" is downloaded in the Archipelago Folder (by clicking START
    SETUP), boot-up the Archipelago Launcher and go to "Options Creator" to create
    your .yaml file and then, when you're done, send it to the person who will host
    the AP Multiworld.
